ription description so  how long does it take well it depends on  how similar the language is to a  language you already know  it also depends on how you go at it if  you can afford a teacher one-on-one  uh even one hour a day  and especially if it's three hours a day  you're going to move along a lot more  quickly being in a classroom with 15  other people i don't consider that to be  intensive  uh  so it depends on that how similar they  are and of course what you want to  achieve  if i always strive to achieve some level  of comfortable fluency ability to talk  about you know a variety of things if  you only want to be able to say a few  pleasantries of course that can be  achieved fairly quickly so i kind of  rambled on a bit  uh i don't know if i covered all the  points but how long does it take  a long time  so you better enjoy it  and the more time you put in every day  the fewer number of months it will take  and you need to decide just what it is  you want to achieve in my case i want to  be able to read i want to be able to  read newspapers listen to radio  watch movies so takes a long time i  think i'm in my arabic adventure for a  good two years but i might just mix in a  bit of farsi and turkish just to whet my  appetite for my next adventure so there  you have it thanks for listening bye for  now  [Music]  you
 

